## Structural Map

Key files Claude reads first:
- `src/app/core/[main].service.ts` — Singleton services shared across features
- `src/app/features/[feature]/[feature].component.ts` — Top-level feature entry point
- `src/app/shared/[component]/[component].component.ts` — Reusable UI components

Layers and their purpose:
- `src/app/core/` → Singleton services, HTTP interceptors, auth guards, error handlers
- `src/app/shared/` → Reusable components, pipes, and directives (imported by feature modules)
- `src/app/features/` → Feature modules or standalone routes; one directory per feature
- `src/environments/` → Environment-specific config (`environment.ts`, `environment.prod.ts`)
- `src/assets/` → Static files (images, fonts, i18n)
- `src/app/store/` → NgRx reducers, selectors, actions, effects (if using NgRx)

